<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ticket Approved & Confirmed</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #e6edf3;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 32px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #fbbf24;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #8b949e;
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        }
        .highlight-text {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .meta-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
        }
        .meta-table td {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .meta-table tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .meta-table td.label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #8b949e;
            width: 35%;
        }
        .meta-table td.value {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: #10b981;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #30363d;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6e7681;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎟️ Pass Approved & Confirmed!</h1>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Your payment verification was successful. Pack your bags for the live event!</p>
        </div>

        <p>Hi <span class="highlight-text">{{fullName}}</span>,</p>
        <p>Your payment proof for transaction <code style="color: #fbbf24;">#{{transactionId}}</code> has been verified and approved by the event organizer.</p>

        <table class="meta-table">
            <tr>
                <td class="label">Event Name</td>
                <td class="value">{{eventName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="label">Total Quantity</td>
                <td class="value">{{quantity}} Ticket Pass(es)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="label">Total Amount Paid</td>
                <td class="value">IDR {{finalPrice}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="label">Status</td>
                <td class="value"><span class="badge">DONE / APPROVED</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p>Please present this confirmation email or your transaction ID at the venue entrance during check-in.</p>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Thank you for choosing Eventura. Enjoy the show!</p>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Eventura Team. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>